Description: Omarchy-compatible Hyprland session for Ubuntu (metapackage)
 Motanka is an Omarchy-compatible Hyprland layer for Ubuntu. It installs
 next to the current desktop as a separate login session, follows
 upstream Omarchy, and removes cleanly.
 .
 This metapackage depends on the Motanka core, the Hyprland stack, the
 archive keyring and the apt source of the matching suite.
